# even if there is no content in this file, must not remove it. Keep it's directory not empty.
#

This directory contains app's private template widget.

--name rule--
non-nested template begin with "_".
nested template begin with alpha. make nested template always after non-nested.

模块控件内的控件id，建议采用“_[tpl_id]_[]”。举个例子：_statusbar_bluetooth_icon。
“_”是前缀，在窗口脚中的id中不建议出现以“_”为前经的id。
“statusbar”是该模板控件的id
“bluetooth_icon”是在该模板控件内区分各控件